# The build context is the repository root; send only what the image needs.
*
!packages/simplex-chat-python/
!apps/simplex-ai-employees/
# secrets: the filled-in .env is read by compose at run time, never baked into the image
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/data
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[co]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/*.egg-info
**/build
**/dist
**/locales/.work
**/zalo-gateway
